<title>GERMANY: Buba revises up Apr Pan-German industry orders. [corrected 17:57 GMT]</title>
<headline>Buba revises up Apr Pan-German industry orders. [corrected 17:57 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following revised index figures:</p>
<p>    PAN-GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS   Apr 97	   Mar 97</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 +3.7 (+3.3)    +0.9 (unch)</p>
<p>(corrects Mar figure and adds preliminary figure)  Year-on-year (pct)		   +7.0 (+6.2)    +4.8 (+5.2)</p>
<p>(corrects Mar figure and adds preliminary figure)  Index (base 1991)		   103.4 (103.0)   99.7 (98.6)</p>
<p>(corrects Mar figure and adds preliminary figure) WEST GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 +3.7 (+3.3)    +0.6 (+0.5)</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +6.3 (+5.3)    +4.2 (+4.1)</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		   101.4 (101.0)   97.8 (97.5)</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 +4.8  (+4.0)   +4.1 (+6.9)</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		  +18.3 (+21.1)  +16.9 (+19.5)</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		   152.9 (151.8)  145.9 (149.0)</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are seasonally adjusted. The percentage change figures are calculated by Reuters from the indices. Previously announced data in brackets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
